  "description": "OLE-STREAM input as projected by ADO, on a read/write copy and a server keyset optimistic Recordset of 'SELECT ID, Code, Txt, B, M FROM Items': AddNew with AppendChunk of 3 then 4 bytes (ActualSize and Value before and after Update); AddNew with AppendChunk then CancelUpdate; AppendChunk of 2 bytes onto the existing ten-byte value of row 1 (no Edit call) then Update; AppendChunk on the Text(50) field; AddNew with two memo AppendChunks and a Null AppendChunk; AddNew with AppendChunk then MoveNext without Update; AddNew with an empty AppendChunk; then every stored row. Asks the accepted pieces, EditMode transitions, partial input on abandonment and the stored values.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
